mode: "100644"
text: "# Surfaces, recipes + two worked examples\n\n## The three-surface system (play each for its job)\n| Surface | Job | Optimise for | Notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Reels** | unconnected **discovery** | first 3s, retention, completion, shares | by category not brand; beats Page posts 5–10× |\n| **Feed** | connected **depth/trust** | comments, saves, shares, dwell | photos (engagement), carousels, 3–8 min video |\n| **Groups** | **community** | meaningful discussion, member reach | 20–40% reach; human-run (`community-management`) |\n\n**The pairing:** for each theme, ship a **Reel (discovery)** + a **Feed post (depth)** — discovery turns\ninto relationship. Don't publish \"for everyone\"; one viewer, ~2 themes.\n\n## Per-surface recipes\n- **Reel (discovery):** hook (first 3s) → 1–3 points → payoff; vertical, captioned, native; category\n  keywords in caption. (Script: `reels-script`.)\n- **Feed photo/carousel (depth):** a value post — mini-tutorial, before/after, strong opinion that\n  invites thoughtful replies; **link (if any) in the first comment**; ask a real question.\n- **Long video (authority):** 3–8 min explainer/demo/breakdown for \"time spent\" + trust.\n- **Group post (community):** ask, share a win, start a discussion — as a member, not a billboard;\n  human-posted, replies handled live.\n\n## Link & format rules\n- **Link in the first comment**, never the post body (links = lowest reach). Or use a native Shop.\n- **No engagement-bait** (\"like & share\"). **Don't** mass-post identical content to many Groups (spam).\n- **Saves & shares > likes** — make it save-worthy and share-worthy.\n\n## Worked example 1 — Reel+Feed pairing (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nTHEME: freelancer tax (one of 2 core themes)\nREEL (discovery): \"Most freelancers overpay tax. One fix.\" → 3 fast points → \"do this today.\" (vertical, captioned)\nFEED (depth): carousel \"The 30% rule, step by step\" + \"What's your setup? 👇\" — link to the guide in FIRST COMMENT.\nENGAGE: post 9am; reply to every comment in the first hour.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — Group community + Feed (warm studio voice)\n```\nTHEME: calm bookkeeping\nGROUP (human): in a small-biz Group, \"What's the one money task you keep avoiding? No judgment 💛\" → reply to each.\nFEED (depth): soft photo + \"The one rule we give every client\" mini-tutorial; question to invite replies.\nREEL (discovery): 20s \"the panic, fixed\" founder-to-camera. Link (newsletter) in first comment.\n```\n\nBoth: read brand-profile + voice-builder first; ~2 themes; Reel for discovery + Feed for depth +\nGroup for community; links in first comment; no bait; first-hour replies. Reels scripted via\n`reels-script`; Page posts/Reels scheduled via `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial`; Group posting +\nreplies are human/in-app; measured in native Meta Insights.\n"
